, and it becomes clear she forgot to buy one.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/EmRsYdQwuEbgynfdrW4n9avKh8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Kota and his friends go to the beach at the suggestion of their senior. There they run into the student monitors, their busty classmate Maya, and policewoman Iida. No matter how much Kota recommends it, Rurumo refuses to change out of her witch outfit and into a swimsuit, and it becomes clear she forgot to buy one.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/EmRsYdQwuEbgynfdrW4n9avKh8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10609","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20708","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"23945","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79208","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"88174","synopsis":"As Kota heads to school, a cute twin-tailed girl with an umbrella descends upon him. Identifying herself as rank 1 witch Warua Haruriri, she offers to establish a contract with Kota.\n\nWhen Kota flees to save his life, Haruriri offers him free use of magic. Rurumo's former classmate from magic school approached Kota knowing he was Rurumo's contractor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xx0xkOT40VxAfDff7xOvm7O3FpY.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"As Kota heads to school, a cute twin-tailed girl with an umbrella descends upon him. Identifying herself as rank 1 witch Warua Haruriri, she offers to establish a contract with Kota.\n\nWhen Kota flees to save his life, Haruriri offers him free use of magic. Rurumo's former classmate from magic school approached Kota knowing he was Rurumo's contractor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xx0xkOT40VxAfDff7xOvm7O3FpY.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10609","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20708","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"23945","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79208","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"88175","synopsis":"The serious student monitor Shimomura Masako loves anime and creates her own cosplay. When Masako brings her cosplay accessory to school, she drops it on the ground. Rurumo witnesses the event. Masako already feels a sense of affinity for Rurumo due to her mistaken belief that her witch's outfit is a cosplay and is moved when Rurumo doesn't mock her hobby, inviting her to a cosplay event.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hWhQNlVhTZtynrvpuUBR0jiVKUC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"The serious student monitor Shimomura Masako loves anime and creates her own cosplay. When Masako brings her cosplay accessory to school, she drops it on the ground. Rurumo witnesses the event. Masako already feels a sense of affinity for Rurumo due to her mistaken belief that her witch's outfit is a cosplay and is moved when Rurumo doesn't mock her hobby, inviting her to a cosplay event.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hWhQNlVhTZtynrvpuUBR0jiVKUC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10609","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20708","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"23945","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79208","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"88176","synopsis":"Surrounded by legends of the Japanese wolf since long ago, the town of Okamimura lies deep within the mountains. Members of the Mysterious Discover Club along with Kota, Rurumo, his classmates Nishino, Sugawara, Sakurai, Maya, and the student monitor trio take a train to Okamimura. Transforming herself into a human, Chiro tags along as Rurumo's younger sister.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jiTRl7iuMuZRO94BQ92t5mETGkb.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Surrounded by legends of the Japanese wolf since long ago, the town of Okamimura lies deep within the mountains. Members of the Mysterious Discover Club along with Kota, Rurumo, his classmates Nishino, Sugawara, Sakurai, Maya, and the student monitor trio take a train to Okamimura. Transforming herself into a human, Chiro tags along as Rurumo's younger sister.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jiTRl7iuMuZRO94BQ92t5mETGkb.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10609","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20708","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"23945","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79208","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"281253","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"88177","synopsis":"Hardly anyone comes to see the MDC at the cultural festival. At this rate, they won't be promoted to an official club. In order to raise the visibility of the MDC, they decide to enter the \"High School Band Heaven\" at Tanako's suggestion. However, when Shibaki and the other members begin practicing, they realize it's too difficult for their male club members...","thumbn